<title>BELGIUM: PARLIAMENTARY COMMISSION SUSPENDS UNTIL 1900.</title>
<headline>PARLIAMENTARY COMMISSION SUSPENDS UNTIL 1900.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The special parliamentary commission examining allegations against Deputy Prime Minister Elio Di Rupo of having sex with under-age boys has suspended its deliberations until 1900 local (1800 GMT).</p>
<p>The commission has to decide whether the evidence is strong enough to warrant recommending to the full Belgian parliament to lift Di Rupo's immunity from prosecution and send him before the Cour de Cassation, the country's highest court.</p>
</text>
